mapping "W6879.1" source="W6879" target="217776008" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target effect=omitted quality=40 {
    confidence 0.71 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source W6879 = Swedish extension of W68 (drowning/submersion following fall into swimming-pool)
        with place=farm (lantbruksområde) and activity unspecified. Target SNOMED CT 4318639 (217776008),
        the Athena Maps-to crosswalk target for parent W68. Target subsumes the source: every W6879 case
        is an accidental drowning in a swimming pool. Target drops the fall mechanism and the Swedish
        place/activity qualifiers (no standard SNOMED CT concept combines swimming-pool drowning with
        place+activity). Broader by one level (place/activity detail lost), high tier per rubric:
        crosswalk-verified, small well-understood breadth mismatch.
        """
}
